{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11341","headline":"巴西驿亭观江涨呈窦使君 · 杜甫","name":"巴西驿亭观江涨呈窦使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿雨南江涨，波涛乱远峰。\n孤亭凌喷薄，万井逼舂容。\n霄汉愁高鸟，泥沙困老龙。\n天边同客舍，携我豁心胸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}